ja talle tullakse järgi.

19
00:01:21.980 --> 00:01:25.500
Kuulake,
meil on vaja üldse allkirja anda,

20
00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:29.420
siis saab kõik korda, luban sulle.
Näe,

21
00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:36.850
siia kirjutas siis oma nimi.
Ära karda, sa oskad ju küll.

22
00:02:55.190 --> 00:02:57.210
Mis temast nüüd saab?

23
00:02:57.310 --> 00:02:59.640
Kellest?

24
00:02:59.740 --> 00:03:02.140
Kuhu ta viiakse?

25
00:03:04.300 --> 00:03:09.140
Ossu, külm on nii palju. Oota,
kuidas see aeg lendab?

26
00:03:09.240 --> 00:03:14.200
Kuule, sa pead ka minema,
sul lapsed ootavad jah? On ju, lapsi.

27
00:04:26.330 --> 00:04:28.150
Martin,

28
00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:31.330
sinust räägitakse,
sa oled mingi president jälle.

29
00:04:31.430 --> 00:04:35.170
Mis oli the role of foreign spin
doctors?

30
00:04:35.270 --> 00:04:38.550
The team of so -called media
consultants was brought in in the

31
00:04:38.650 --> 00:04:42.690
last moment and quite surprisingly
all charges were dropped soon after

32
00:04:42.690 --> 00:04:44.550
that.

33
00:04:44.650 --> 00:04:47.030
In the other news,
the world of sport was shocked

34
00:04:47.130 --> 00:04:52.010
yesterday when The diaries from
Estonia were denied of their win in

35
00:04:52.010 --> 00:04:55.990
the court of arbitrage of sports.
Is doping really becoming so much of

36
00:04:55.990 --> 00:05:00.950
a probleem in the olympic swimming?
And you have a special report.

37
00:05:04.710 --> 00:05:07.735
Martin,
meil on üks küsimus sinu juurde.

38
00:05:22.240 --> 00:05:24.820
Going to some place colder,
much colder.

39
00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:27.380
You are watching the news,

40
00:05:27.480 --> 00:05:30.220
doping, Estonia. Forgott it.

41
00:05:37.080 --> 00:05:39.755
Platon. Which I don't have.

42
00:05:41.490 --> 00:05:44.990
In Barcelona anyway,
your things are getting pretty nasty

43
00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:47.050
