Don't you have any national pride?

44
00:05:47.150 --> 00:05:49.225
No,

45
00:05:50.540 --> 00:05:53.015
I will not go back.

46
00:06:05.060 --> 00:06:07.120
Jah, Martin,
see ei tööta juba ammu enam,

47
00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:09.260
